# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Note: GitHub blocks uploading new Git LFS objects to a public fork when the upstream repo does not have LFS enabled
# ("can not upload new objects to public fork chasejltl/WildOmission"). Binary assets are therefore stored as standard
# Git blobs (matching upstream TelephoneStudios/WildOmission) and procedural Blender generators live under Art/Blender/.
*.blend binary
*.fbx binary
*.uasset binary
*.umap binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.png binary
*.tga binary
